OL,3,GNEWSATwo more unions join school
OL,4,Astrikes over academy plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Diocese of Lancaster, which covers
OL,7,Fcentral and north Lancashire and the
OL,8,FFylde coast, has said the plans would
OL,9,Fguarantee "high-quality Catholic
OL,10,Feducation" across the area.
